They find out that the bomb remote detonator is broken.

2024
01:28:03.340 --> 01:28:04.380
The trigger is dead.

2025
01:28:04.380 --> 01:28:07.480
They can't get on the space shuttle and fly away and detonate it.

2026
01:28:07.820 --> 01:28:10.600
Someone has to stay behind and do it by hand.

2027
01:28:10.780 --> 01:28:11.040
Yeah.

2028
01:28:11.680 --> 01:28:12.080
So.

2029
01:28:12.520 --> 01:28:12.660
Yeah.

2030
01:28:12.880 --> 01:28:13.060
Yeah.

2031
01:28:13.180 --> 01:28:14.760
They're going to have to draw straws.

2032
01:28:14.800 --> 01:28:16.760
Well, first, Bruce Willis says he'll do it.

2033
01:28:16.860 --> 01:28:17.040
Yeah.

2034
01:28:17.160 --> 01:28:18.740
And then they're like, no way, no way.

2035
01:28:18.840 --> 01:28:20.540
