2036
01:28:20.700 --> 01:28:20.980
Also.

2037
01:28:21.640 --> 01:28:22.980
Why can't he be the one?

2038
01:28:23.020 --> 01:28:23.360
I don't know.

2039
01:28:23.480 --> 01:28:23.880
He volunteered.

2040
01:28:24.160 --> 01:28:24.360
Well.

2041
01:28:24.420 --> 01:28:27.000
But now everybody's volunteering, except for AJ.

2042
01:28:27.500 --> 01:28:28.820
AJ does not volunteer.

2043
01:28:29.140 --> 01:28:30.900
And Steve Buscemi really wants it.

2044
01:28:31.060 --> 01:28:32.380
He's like, guys, I got this.

2045
01:28:32.520 --> 01:28:32.900
I know.

2046
01:28:32.900 --> 01:28:33.380
He'll do it.

2047
01:28:33.520 --> 01:28:35.220
Well, you can't let Crazy Guy do it.

2048
01:28:35.360 --> 01:28:35.640
No.

2049
01:28:35.780 --> 01:28:36.840
So I agree with that.

2050
01:28:37.020 --> 01:28:37.200
Yeah.

2051
01:28:37.560 --> 01:28:41.940
So they agree to draw straws, and AJ gets the short straw.

2052
01:28:42.240 --> 01:28:42.420
Yeah.

2053
01:28:43.220 --> 01:28:45.880
So Bruce Willis says, I'll take AJ down.

2054
01:28:45.880 --> 01:28:47.060
I'll get him set up.

2055
01:28:47.740 --> 01:28:52.000
And when they get down there, he sabotages AJ's space suit.

2056
01:28:52.000 --> 01:28:56.520
Yeah, he like steps out of the airlock and then shuts him in or something.

2057
01:28:56.520 --> 01:28:57.820
I didn't understand that.

2058
01:28:57.880 --> 01:29:01.580
He like, he does something to a space suit that compromises it.

2059
01:29:01.700 --> 01:29:02.080
Mm-hmm.

2060
01:29:02.260 --> 01:29:08.380
And then as AJ's like gasping for air, he shoves him back into the little elevator thing

2061
01:29:08.380 --> 01:29:09.440
that goes to the ship.

2062
01:29:09.580 --> 01:29:10.780
And it's airlocked.

2063
01:29:10.900 --> 01:29:11.120
Yeah.

2064
01:29:11.320 --> 01:29:14.240
And Bruce is on the other side of it, outside on the asteroid.

2065
01:29:14.520 --> 01:29:17.040
And Bruce is saying, take care of my little girl.

2066
01:29:17.280 --> 01:29:17.560
Yeah.

2067
01:29:17.560 --> 01:29:18.680
I cried again.

2068
01:29:18.900 --> 01:29:19.900
I cried here as well.

2069
01:29:20.100 --> 01:29:21.020
I cried.

2070
01:29:21.200 --> 01:29:21.480
Yeah.

2071
01:29:21.920 --> 01:29:22.580
Second time.

2072
01:29:22.840 --> 01:29:23.000
Okay.

2073
01:29:23.320 --> 01:29:29.180
I have an audio clip of Ben Affleck talking about shooting this scene because he was really

2074
01:29:29.180 --> 01:29:29.700
sick.

2075
01:29:30.120 --> 01:29:31.120
Oh, yes.

2076
01:29:31.300 --> 01:29:31.720
Yes.

2077
01:29:32.180 --> 01:29:32.960
Let's hear it.

2078
01:29:33.400 --> 01:29:36.480
When we shot that scene, I had food poisoning.

2079
01:29:36.820 --> 01:29:41.100
And I wasn't an experienced enough actor at that point to know that you can just pick up

2080
01:29:41.100 --> 01:29:43.140
the phone and be like, I'm too sick to work today.

2081
01:29:43.420 --> 01:29:45.100
I was like, I better come in.

2082
01:29:45.100 --> 01:29:49.380
And I went in there and I was literally, it's the only time I've ever met in my life, vomiting

2083
01:29:49.380 --> 01:29:50.140
between takes.

2084
01:29:50.240 --> 01:29:51.860
They had a garbage can.

2085
01:29:52.980 --> 01:29:54.800
And I probably made the scene better.

2086
01:29:57.500 --> 01:29:59.740
I mean, his performance is really good in that.

2087
01:29:59.900 --> 01:30:00.420
I cried.

2088
01:30:00.560 --> 01:30:01.020
I cried.

2089
01:30:01.420 --> 01:30:04.080
I didn't cry, but I was like, I felt gutted.

2090
01:30:04.380 --> 01:30:05.140
I cried.

2091
01:30:05.340 --> 01:30:08.200
And then, well, here's the part that made me sad.

2092
01:30:08.820 --> 01:30:12.660
I got a little teary because now I don't really know how he did it.

2093
01:30:12.780 --> 01:30:15.360
But Bruce Willis's character here, he's able to.

2094
01:30:16.120 --> 01:30:17.500
He's able to call Houston.

2095
01:30:17.660 --> 01:30:19.440
Somehow he gets enough communication.

2096
01:30:19.860 --> 01:30:20.900
In his suit.

2097
01:30:22.300 --> 01:30:26.280
Somehow to call and tell his daughter he's not coming home.

2098
01:30:26.400 --> 01:30:27.680
But he's in his space suit.

2099
01:30:27.860 --> 01:30:29.800
But on the screen, he's not in a suit.

2100
01:30:29.960 --> 01:30:30.560
Is that right?

2101
01:30:30.760 --> 01:30:31.200
Yes.

2102
01:30:31.400 --> 01:30:32.800
I didn't notice that.

2103
01:30:33.020 --> 01:30:34.160
But it's very sad.

2104
01:30:34.600 --> 01:30:35.420
It's very sad.

2105
01:30:35.420 --> 01:30:36.980
And you know what I thought?

2106
01:30:37.200 --> 01:30:39.600
He says to her, you know, you get married.

2107
01:30:39.720 --> 01:30:41.920
You're going to spend your life with AJ.

2108
01:30:42.080 --> 01:30:44.160
I thought, my God, these two can never get divorced.

2109
01:30:44.220 --> 01:30:44.660
I know.

2110
01:30:44.860 --> 01:30:45.800
I thought that too.

2111
01:30:46.000 --> 01:30:46.880
I thought that too.

2112
01:30:47.040 --> 01:30:48.640
I'm like, you better stick it out.

2113
01:30:48.840 --> 01:30:50.840
You can never break up with this guy.

2114
01:30:51.000 --> 01:30:53.460
Your dad gave his life so you could marry him.

2115
01:30:53.620 --> 01:30:54.060
Yes.

2116
01:30:54.400 --> 01:30:55.500
Well, guess what?

2117
01:30:55.900 --> 01:30:57.560
It's not the end of the probleMs.

2118
01:30:58.280 --> 01:31:02.340
Now, step seven is take off from the asteroid.

2119
01:31:02.620 --> 01:31:02.860
Yeah.

2120
01:31:03.300 --> 01:31:05.140
And the engines won't start.

2121
01:31:05.420 --> 01:31:05.680
No.

2122
01:31:05.900 --> 01:31:09.660
The female pilot and the Russian go down to try to fix the problem.

2123
01:31:10.040 --> 01:31:12.100
She's trying to do some official things.

2124
01:31:12.280 --> 01:31:15.860
The Russian fixes it by banging something with a wrench.

2125
01:31:16.200 --> 01:31:17.580
And they have liftoff.

2126
01:31:17.780 --> 01:31:18.080
Yeah.

2127
01:31:18.240 --> 01:31:21.020
But the meteor is exploding randomly again.

2128
01:31:21.860 --> 01:31:23.400
But you guys, they make it.

2129
01:31:23.580 --> 01:31:25.340
They do get off the thing.

2130
01:31:25.440 --> 01:31:25.780
Mm-hmm.

2131
01:31:25.780 --> 01:31:31.740
But Harry is now out of range of the detonator because of all the things that are exploding

2132
01:31:31.740 --> 01:31:32.340
randomly.

2133
01:31:32.760 --> 01:31:33.240
Yeah.

2134
01:31:33.240 --> 01:31:38.000
The meteor is about to cross the threshold of the barrier where they can detonate it.

2135
01:31:38.120 --> 01:31:38.280
Right.

2136
01:31:38.280 --> 01:31:39.140
Because here's the thing.

2137
01:31:39.320 --> 01:31:45.620
If they detonate it too late, then it's going to split in half, but the two halves are still

2138
01:31:45.620 --> 01:31:46.420
going to hit the Earth.

2139
01:31:46.420 --> 01:31:46.700
Yeah.

2140
01:31:46.900 --> 01:31:50.920
There was this line they had to detonate before they crossed this line.

2141
01:31:51.120 --> 01:31:52.480
But he presses it.

2142
01:31:52.580 --> 01:31:55.520
He had only 20 seconds left, but he presses it.

2143
01:31:55.660 --> 01:31:57.140
The meteor splits in half.

2144
01:31:57.560 --> 01:32:04.500
Somehow, the blast radius from this nuclear bomb does not reach the shuttle, which is still

2145
01:32:04.500 --> 01:32:05.680
very close to it.

2146
01:32:05.680 --> 01:32:06.760
There's no way.

2147
01:32:06.900 --> 01:32:12.800
When you see the special effect, it sent like a ginormous sonic wave through space.

2148
01:32:12.800 --> 01:32:15.320
It just would have obliterated anything.

2149
01:32:15.720 --> 01:32:15.940
The space shuttle.

2150
01:32:16.220 --> 01:32:16.420
Yeah.

2151
01:32:16.600 --> 01:32:17.820
But they make it.

2152
01:32:18.060 --> 01:32:18.860
It's okay.

2153
01:32:19.620 --> 01:32:23.200
We have cheers at Houston and around the world.

2154
01:32:23.200 --> 01:32:25.620
A lot of slow motion celebration.

2155
01:32:26.000 --> 01:32:26.160
Yeah.

2156
01:32:26.780 --> 01:32:30.680
Again, dressed like they live on a prairie in the 1800s.

2157
01:32:30.680 --> 01:32:31.100
Mm-hmm.

2158
01:32:31.660 --> 01:32:35.200
Grace knows her dad is gone and Billy Bob Thornton hugs her.

2159
01:32:35.200 --> 01:32:35.600
Yeah.

2160
01:32:35.840 --> 01:32:40.300
The line that Harry said to her that got me before they lost radio contact, he says,

2161
01:32:40.760 --> 01:32:42.500
I'll look in on you from time to time.

2162
01:32:42.660 --> 01:32:43.220
Mm-hmm.

2163
01:32:43.340 --> 01:32:44.120
And that got me.

2164
01:32:44.360 --> 01:32:45.180
That got me.

2165
01:32:45.280 --> 01:32:48.980
You guys, once they land, you know, they get off the space shuttle.

2166
01:32:49.100 --> 01:32:51.260
There's lots of hugging and like you said, right?

2167
01:32:51.380 --> 01:32:52.280
It's in slow motion.

2168
01:32:52.500 --> 01:32:52.680
Yeah.

2169
01:32:52.880 --> 01:32:55.520
Grace and AJ's slow motion run to each other.

2170
01:32:56.120 --> 01:32:59.700
Chick's son is there to greet him with a slow motion run.

2171
01:32:59.920 --> 01:33:00.100
Yeah.

2172
01:33:00.260 --> 01:33:01.540
And I cried at that.

2173
01:33:01.940 --> 01:33:02.300
Yeah.

2174
01:33:02.300 --> 01:33:06.520
I cried at the fact that this dad was going to be back in his son's life.

2175
01:33:06.600 --> 01:33:06.840
Yeah.

2176
01:33:07.020 --> 01:33:07.440
Got me.

2177
01:33:07.700 --> 01:33:07.980
Yeah.

2178
01:33:08.200 --> 01:33:12.240
And AJ gives Billy Bob's character the shuttle patch.

2179
01:33:12.560 --> 01:33:12.960
Yes.

2180
01:33:13.600 --> 01:33:13.960
Yeah.

2181
01:33:13.960 --> 01:33:20.000
And oh, I also cried when Colonel Sharp wanted to shake Grace's hand because her dad was the

2182
01:33:20.000 --> 01:33:20.280
hero.

2183
01:33:20.280 --> 01:33:26.340
He said, I wanted to shake the hand of the daughter of the man who saved the world.

2184
01:33:26.340 --> 01:33:27.360
It's very moving.

2185
01:33:27.600 --> 01:33:32.240
You know, I have a clip from the DVD commentary where Bruce Willis talked about what it was

2186
01:33:32.240 --> 01:33:33.400
like to work on this movie.

2187
01:33:33.580 --> 01:33:34.220
Let's hear it.

2188
01:33:34.820 --> 01:33:38.680
It was a nice change for me working with an ensemble cast like we had in Armageddon.

2189
01:33:39.380 --> 01:33:40.860
All really funny guys.

2190
01:33:41.880 --> 01:33:47.740
My strongest memory of now is how much we laughed every day and just try to keep cracking

2191
01:33:47.740 --> 01:33:48.400
each other up.

2192
01:33:48.860 --> 01:33:51.140
So it sounds like they had a really good time.

2193
01:33:51.140 --> 01:33:55.540
This movie, it has a tag over the credits.

2194
01:33:55.800 --> 01:33:56.040
It does.

2195
01:33:56.380 --> 01:33:58.040
AJ and Grace get married.

2196
01:33:58.280 --> 01:33:59.160
I loved that.

2197
01:33:59.160 --> 01:34:00.020
It was lovely.

2198
01:34:00.280 --> 01:34:01.000
It made me happy.

2199
01:34:01.460 --> 01:34:03.040
And then the movie's over.

2200
01:34:03.140 --> 01:34:03.800
And that's it.

2201
01:34:03.940 --> 01:34:04.520
That's it.

2202
01:34:04.640 --> 01:34:05.180
You did it.

2203
01:34:05.300 --> 01:34:06.860
Two hours and 31 minutes.

2204
