You have one note.

2205
01:34:08.740 --> 01:34:08.920
Yeah.

2206
01:34:09.660 --> 01:34:15.340
I just think that during that final slow motion montage of everyone on Earth being happy

2207
01:34:15.340 --> 01:34:20.780
that the meteor was destroyed, it would have been really nice if we could have just seen

2208
01:34:20.780 --> 01:34:22.400
Bike Guy hugging his dog.

2209
01:34:22.580 --> 01:34:22.820
Yeah.

2210
01:34:22.980 --> 01:34:26.560
