I would love to have seen the dog with like a Godzilla toy in his mouth, shaking it.

2216
01:34:38.280 --> 01:34:38.520
Something.

2217
01:34:38.520 --> 01:34:42.500
And maybe Dottie flipping off her husband, but like with a smile.

2218
01:34:42.700 --> 01:34:42.960
Yeah.

2219
01:34:43.180 --> 01:34:44.060
Like, F you.

2220
01:34:44.340 --> 01:34:44.920
We did it.

2221
01:34:45.200 --> 01:34:45.460
Yeah.

2222
01:34:46.040 --> 01:34:47.640
If I had been in the room.

2223
01:34:47.980 --> 01:34:48.320
Yeah.

2224
01:34:48.440 --> 01:34:49.740
I would have given that note.

2225
01:34:50.140 --> 01:34:50.360
Yeah.

2226
01:34:50.760 --> 01:34:51.040
I would.

2227
01:34:51.360 --> 01:34:51.420
No.

2228
01:34:52.740 --> 01:34:53.380
Just the one.

2229
01:34:53.660 --> 01:34:54.160
Otherwise, otherwise.

2230
01:34:54.520 --> 01:34:55.600
Don't change anything.

2231
01:34:55.860 --> 01:34:56.660
Don't change a thing.

2232
01:34:57.000 --> 01:35:00.680
Definitely keep in the leaving on a jet plane sequence.

2233
01:35:04.140 --> 01:35:05.720
Sam, final thoughts?

2234
01:35:06.320 --> 01:35:07.360
I love it.

2235
01:35:07.360 --> 01:35:08.460
It's not good.

2236
01:35:08.460 --> 01:35:09.220
I love it.

2237
01:35:09.300 --> 01:35:10.240
That's a great quote.

2238
01:35:10.240 --> 01:35:12.140
It's not good, but I love it.

2239
01:35:12.220 --> 01:35:13.040
That's how I feel.

2240
01:35:13.320 --> 01:35:13.580
Yeah.

2241
01:35:14.040 --> 01:35:16.840
I'm excited to know that they had a good time, you know?

2242
01:35:17.080 --> 01:35:22.380
And I really look forward to the road trip you and I take where we listen to the DVD

2243
01:35:22.380 --> 01:35:23.040
commentary.

2244
01:35:23.480 --> 01:35:24.620
Can I add something real quick?

2245
01:35:24.760 --> 01:35:24.900
Yeah.

2246
01:35:25.000 --> 01:35:25.260
Yes.

2247
01:35:25.600 --> 01:35:31.260
I really admire all of your work breaking down this movie, your attention to detail.

2248
01:35:31.460 --> 01:35:32.720
I found it so exhausting.

2249
01:35:32.720 --> 01:35:37.760
And the way you really got in there, took the whole thing seriously, looked into everything.

2250
01:35:37.860 --> 01:35:38.600
I'm in awe.

2251
01:35:38.760 --> 01:35:39.180
Well done.

